  "readings": [
    "39 of 79 drawn rows are a single unbroken run across most of the width, the widest spanning 24px, and only 25 have background between two parts of the silhouette. The masses have fused, so the shape reads as one object however well it is shaded: separate the limbs by two or three pixels of background before shading anything.",
